        "id": "contract-packets",
        "topicId": "financials.contract-packets",
        "title": "Contract Packets and Executed Copies",
        "summary": "Create a full construction contract packet from the exact estimate revision that will become CA22. Review the packet number and version, contractor entity, dates, project and owner information, deposit and payment terms, signers, and included document versions. Preview the combined PDF before preparing it for Foxit or marking it sent for signatures outside Compass. A sent packet is frozen; duplicate it to revise the terms or document set.",
        "content": "Create a full construction contract packet from the exact estimate revision that will become CA22. Review the packet number and version, contractor entity, dates, project and owner information, deposit and payment terms, signers, and included document versions. Preview the combined PDF before preparing it for Foxit or marking it sent for signatures outside Compass. A sent packet is frozen; duplicate it to revise the terms or document set.\n\nCompass locks the packet as executed only after all required signers finish or an authorized user records a complete manually signed copy. Confirm the executed PDF contains every required owner and company representative signature before attesting. Executed owner contract packets appear in the owner's **Plans & Documents** area.\n\nUse **Replace active contract document** only when the active archival copy is unavailable or needs a corrected presentation copy. The replacement must be the same complete, fully executed agreement. Enter a reason and attest that no signed terms or signature content changed. Compass preserves the prior link and records the replacement in activity history; the execution date, signature references, and contract status remain unchanged."
