        "content": "A project's Overview shows **What's happening**: daily logs, to-dos opened or worked on, client contact, office time logged against the job, machine hours and schedule changes, by day with the newest first. Use the buttons above it to show one kind at a time, and **Show the … days before** to look further back. Each row links to its log, to-do or schedule. **Hours by cost code** beside it adds up the cost code lines on the same days' daily logs, split into hours on to-dos and the rest.\n\nOnly staff see the timeline. A daily log marked **Shared with the owner** is one owner updates can use. Admins choose what the timeline shows in **Settings → Workflows → Project timeline**."
