        "content": "**Dashboard** uses the same overall layout as the office workspace while showing only information shared with you. Open your project's map panel for site context and use **Messages** to find your unread items when available. Counts, summaries, and links remain limited to your project assignment and published owner information.\n\nUse the left navigation on a larger screen or project controls on a smaller screen. **Print Preview** opens a point-in-time copy in a new tab, with **Print / Save PDF**; it does not change or approve a record. A shared layout does not expose staff financials or internal messages."
